---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import portrait from '../assets/brand/karmijn.jpg';
---

<Base title="About — Karmijn Simons">
  <section
    class="mx-auto flex max-w-[1440px] flex-col gap-[53px] px-6 pt-[122px] pb-[72px] md:gap-[39px] md:px-[60px] md:pt-[90px] md:pb-[60px] lg:flex-row lg:gap-[66px] lg:px-[100px] lg:pt-[150px] lg:pb-[150px]"
  >
    <div class="lg:w-[537px] lg:shrink-0">
      <h1 class="heading-lg">About me</h1>
      <div class="lead mt-[14px] lg:space-y-5 md:mt-12 md:max-w-[650px] lg:mt-[55px]">
        <p>
          I create visual work that helps people make sense of complex ideas. From illustration and visual systems to physical
          objects, I translate stories, structures, and themes into clear, thoughtful forms. My work often lives in public,
          educational, or societal contexts, where care, nuance, and clarity really matter.
        </p>
        <p>
          I work at the intersection of illustration, design, and making. Some projects result in illustrations or visual
          frameworks, others take shape as physical pieces. The form depends on the story, not the other way around.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’m drawn to projects that ask for more than a quick visual solution.<br />
          Work that involves layered information, sensitive topics, or systems that need to be understood. That can be public
          communication for municipalities, educational tools, or visual work within fintech and other complex fields.
        </p>
        <p>
          Clarity is central in everything I do, but never at the cost of tone or meaning. I care about how something lands,
          who it’s for, and what it needs to carry.
        </p>
        <p>
          I usually work closely with teams, from early ideas to final form. Asking questions, shaping the visual language
          together, and making sure the outcome feels considered and grounded.
        </p>
        <p>
          If you’re working on something that needs care, structure, and a clear visual voice, feel free to get in touch.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <Image
      src={portrait}
      alt="Karmijn Simons holding an open book in front of a light blue bookcase"
      widths={[400, 700, 1000, 1366]}
      sizes="(min-width: 1200px) 640px, 100vw"
      class="h-[600px] w-full object-cover md:h-[1115px] lg:h-[807px] lg:flex-1"
      loading="eager"
    />
  </section>
</Base>
